# Rotational-mesh gate on the BOSL2 spur pair in gears.scad (selftest: PASS).
# One mesh cycle of kin_phase in 8 steps: the pair must never interfere and
# never separate, and the jam/gap pairs prove both checks can fail.
steps 8
sweep kin_phase
empty mesh-clear             # gearA ∩ gearB — no interference at any phase
nonempty mesh-engaged        # grow(gearA) ∩ gearB — teeth still touching at every phase
empty-control mesh-jam       # centre distance shrunk: must interfere
nonempty-control mesh-gap    # centre distance grown: must gap out
